# Styling (Tailwind CSS v4)

When styling UI in `apps/` or `packages/ui/`:

1. Read @DESIGN.md (rule `.cursor/rules/design.mdc`), then [packages/ui/src/styles/globals.css](packages/ui/src/styles/globals.css)
2. Use **Tailwind utility classes** — avoid new CSS Modules unless Tailwind cannot express the style
3. Merge classes with `cn()` from `@repo/ui/cn` (apps) or `./lib/cn` (within `@repo/ui`). Canonical component: @packages/ui/src/button.tsx
4. Use `@theme` tokens (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `bg-primary`, `border-border`, `rounded-pill`, etc.) — do not hardcode hex in components. Token hex lives in DESIGN.md + `globals.css` only.
5. Motion + Tailwind: do not put `transition-*` on `motion.*` elements (see `.agents/skills/motion-react/SKILL.md`)

## Monorepo CSS

- Shared theme: `@import "@repo/ui/styles.css"` in app `globals.css` (`apps/*/src/_app/styles/globals.css`)
- App scan: `@source` paths are relative to that CSS file
- UI scan: `@source "../**/*.{ts,tsx}"` in [packages/ui/src/styles/globals.css](packages/ui/src/styles/globals.css)
- Do **not** import UI and app Tailwind CSS separately — one build per app

